{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"inventory.schema.json","title":"Inventory（W0 盤點）","description":"W0 產出（docs/02 §5）：檔案清單、語言、套件清單、框架與萃取器、端點、資料庫（表、RLS、policy、函式、storage bucket）、認證、環境變數名稱、盲點與功能旗標。只有 hash、位置與名稱，不含程式內容與值。被路徑黑名單排除的檔案仍列出（excluded: true），但永遠不送 LLM。發現項與威脅以 JSON Pointer 引用這裡的事實（E-INVENTORY-REF）；各處 source／file 必須是 files 中的路徑（E-INVENTORY）。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"run_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/run_id"},
"repo_commit":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{7,64}$"},
"generated_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},
"files":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},"language":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"bytes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"excluded":{"type":"boolean"},"exclude_reason":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["path_blacklist","binary","generated","vendored","too_large"]},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["path","sha256","language","bytes","excluded","exclude_reason"]},"minItems":1},
"manifests":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"ecosystem":{"enum":["pypi","npm","maven","go","cargo","other"]}},"required":["path","ecosystem"]}},
"frameworks":{"type":"array","description":"偵測到的框架與負責的確定性萃取器（tools.yaml inventory:<name>）；support＝unsupported 的框架同時列入 blind_spots","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"version":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"extractor":{"type":"string","pattern":"^inventory:[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$"},"support":{"enum":["full","partial","unsupported"]}},"required":["name","version","extractor","support"]}},
"endpoints":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"method":{"enum":["GET","HEAD","OPTIONS","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]},"path":{"type":"string"},"file":{"type":"string"},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"kind":{"enum":["http","server_action","graphql","rpc","baas_direct","webhook"]},"auth_required":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"null＝萃取器無法判斷"},"middleware_refs":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"auth.middleware[].middleware_id"},"writes":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"v0.4：抽取器判定 handler 是否寫入資料或觸發外部動作（ORM 的 create／update／delete、SQL 寫入、寄信或金流 SDK 呼叫）；null＝無法判定。GET／HEAD 端點為 true 時必須列在 seed manifest 的 state_changing_reads（E-SEED-SIDE-EFFECT）。省略視同 null"}},"required":["method","path","file","line","kind","auth_required","middleware_refs"]}},
"llm_integrations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file":{"type":"string"},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"kind":{"enum":["llm_call","tool_definition","prompt_template","rag_store"]}},"required":["file","line","kind"]}},
"db":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "engine":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},
  "tables":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"table_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^TBL-[0-9]{3,}$"},"schema":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"rls_enabled":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"null＝無法從 repo 判斷（例如只在管理介面設定）"},"policies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"command":{"enum":["ALL","SELECT","INSERT","UPDATE","DELETE"]},"roles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/source"}},"required":["name","command","roles","source"]}},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/source"}},"required":["table_id","schema","name","rls_enabled","policies","source"]}},
  "functions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"security_definer":{"type":"boolean"},"source":{"$ref":"#/$defs/source"}},"required":["name","security_definer","source"]}},
  "storage_buckets":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"public":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}]},"source":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/source"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["name","public","source"]}}},
  "required":["engine","tables","functions","storage_buckets"]},
"auth":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"providers":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"middleware":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"middleware_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^MW-[0-9]{3,}$"},"name":{"type":"string"},"file":{"type":"string"},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["middleware_id","name","file","line"]}},"roles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["providers","middleware","roles"]},
"env_vars":{"type":"array","description":"只有名稱與引用位置，永遠不含值；public_prefix＝名稱以 NEXT_PUBLIC_、VITE_、EXPO_PUBLIC_ 或 PUBLIC_ 開頭（會進前端 bundle）","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*$"},"public_prefix":{"type":"boolean"},"referenced_in":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/source"}}},"required":["name","public_prefix","referenced_in"]}},
"blind_spots":{"type":"array","description":"W0 看不到或不完整的部分；列入報告限制","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"enum":["dashboard_only_setting","unsupported_framework","dynamic_route","generated_code","other"]},"description":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","description"]}},
"features":{"type":"array","uniqueItems":true,"items":{"enum":["file_upload","outbound_http","webhook_inbound","payments","oauth","llm_tools","frontend_bundle","crypto"]},"description":"確定性偵測的功能旗標；決定 MANDATORY_FACETS（vchlib.facets）"},
"redaction_map_ref":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256","description":"W0 的 secrets 遮罩對照表（redaction-map）"},
"sbom_ref":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256_or_null"}},
"required":["run_id","repo_commit","generated_at","files","manifests","frameworks","endpoints","llm_integrations","db","auth","env_vars","blind_spots","features","redaction_map_ref","sbom_ref"],
"$defs":{"source":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file":{"type":"string"},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["file","line"]}}}
